apter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p039","text":"裏克等已殺奚齊、悼子，使人迎公子重耳於翟，欲立之。重耳謝曰：「負父之命出奔，父死不得修人子之禮侍喪，重耳何敢入！大夫其更立他子。」還報裏克，裏克使迎夷吾於梁。夷吾欲往，呂省、郤芮曰：「内猶有公子可立者而外求，難信。計非之秦，輔彊國之威以入，恐危。」乃使郤芮厚賂秦，約曰：「卽得入，請以晉河西之地與秦。」及遺裏克書曰：「誠得立，請遂封子於汾陽之邑。」秦繆公乃發兵送夷吾於晉。齊桓公聞晉内亂，亦率諸侯如晉。秦兵與夷吾亦至晉，齊乃使隰朋會秦倶入夷吾，立爲晉君，是爲惠公。齊桓公至晉之髙梁而還歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"uon_qea_38x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"悼子","kind":"person","person_id":"dkc_j4z_klk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"公子重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"uon_qea_38x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"uon_qea_38x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0084","start":84,"end